--   1. Swiss bold minimalist #ff0a94 / #ffffff / #000000 visual architecture on GET /
--      with zero rounded corners (`border-radius:0`), zero backslashes, zero neon-green
--      slop (`#18e68c`), and zero third-party company branding (`Latch`, `Periodic`).
--   2. Dark black (#000000) minimalist technical monospace interactive Univalent Portal
--      (embedded at `#portal` on `/` and full-viewport on `/portal`, `/os`, `/supercomputer`)
--      coupling:
--        * Real in-browser C11 CCHM `cubical.wasm` typechecker & normalizer WebWorker
--        * Port-accurate Lafont principal-port (`p0 <-> p0`) interaction-net compiler & reducer
--        * Exhaustive truth-table miter-verified (`tt(c0) ^ tt(c1) == 0`) line-rate symbolic
--          cone synthesizer + `/hx/cryptic-inet.wasm` & `/hx/blackbox.wasm` verification
